    <title>v2.29.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v2.28.0...v2.29.0&quot;&gt;2.29.0&lt;/a&gt; (2026-10-07)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &lt;code&gt;&quot;allowlist&quot;: &quot;disabled&quot;&lt;/code&gt; in environment network config. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/fa4acc70a56fe8118914d58a0d8767d5b3c51f21&quot;&gt;fa4acc7&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update discovery doc (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/84bf19c9394bb3cc41f56c11d125cf6e5de86e3a&quot;&gt;84bf19c&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Only log direct AFC warning when functions are present in the config (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/6e36aaae5b03b955de6297b71f57452cfc744ac8&quot;&gt;6e36aaa&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Documentation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refresh docs for 2.28.0 (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/618f0aa89c7fa61be973fabfa5747fb93a21b1bf&quot;&gt;618f0aa&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update code samples to gemini-flash-latest, gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image, and gemini-3.8-flash-tts (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/5673494fdb2a5db875e0d7f68c18bb2e1029af12&quot;&gt;5673494&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update generated SDK docstring examples to use gemini-flash-latest (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/28e0915b4b57607badafb3181b19c67fb7b475c9&quot;&gt;28e0915&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
