    <title>v2.25.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v2.24.0...v2.25.0&quot;&gt;2.25.0&lt;/a&gt; (2026-09-22)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add sample_audio to Voice in GAOS SDK (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/a011633c2db0078019162880764e06cd85a5c4ff&quot;&gt;a011633&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Voices API resource to GAOS SDK (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/c45b94e7a0e0dcd5dcc2590f62f5d223f8c90e99&quot;&gt;c45b94e&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expose SpeechMetadata, VoiceConfig.voice, and SpeechAnnotation in public GenAI SDKs (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/a6d32434b848ada0a635dae38406811dbf4a7c67&quot;&gt;a6d3243&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support field.value_field syntax for map add_union_value annotations. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/ad00721acd27258ae45180dbb7dadfaa8f8bed71&quot;&gt;ad00721&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update discovery doc (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/fa917165422ebd78f69bfd7a1b6285d2ad35780b&quot;&gt;fa91716&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wire voice into sdk (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/e1d68b4855bc58eb30e455c37b4531ff09f4abb9&quot;&gt;e1d68b4&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sanitize path parameter descriptions in GAOS OpenAPI generation (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/25b00947000778c45fd804dffee282f3bdd7e3e7&quot;&gt;25b0094&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
